OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with sunny spells in the
OL,6,Fsouth. Northern areas see a few
OL,7,Fshowers initially, then rain spreads
OL,8,Feast later, this heavy at times on
OL,9,Fwestern hills. Near-normal
OL,10,Ftemperatures, warmest south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain spreading
OL,13,Facross northern areas tonight, turning
OL,14,Fheavy at times. Dry in the south with
OL,15,Fclear spells and a few fog patches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FRain in the north with some
OL,18,Fheavy downpours in Scotland at times
OL,19,Fand a small risk of thunder. Dry and
OL,20,Fsunny in the south, feeling more humid
OL,21,Fthan of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
